cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis code, please cite it as below."
title: "Golden Hour intervention at Sally Mugabe Central Hospital — analysis code"
abstract: >-
  R analysis scripts for the evaluation of a Golden Hour quality-improvement
  intervention (delayed cord clamping and early skin-to-skin care) in the
  neonatal service at Sally Mugabe Central Hospital, Harare, Zimbabwe, using
  routinely collected Neotree and maternal delivery-log data. Code only; no
  patient data are included.
type: software
